# pop'n music 9, e-AMUSEMENT on (popn9-eamuse-on.his): boot (CARD R/W CHECK and 10 KEY CHECK pass),
# then test mode > CARD R/W CHECK > CARD CHECK, and the card put in. The game reads it and says
# CHECK IS COMPLETED. NEW CARD (a fresh card.bin), then ejects it.
#   hiraku-popn9 --nvram DIR --script oracle/scripts/popn9-cardcheck.his
game popn9
at 4400 press "Test" 8
at 4520 press "P1 Button 6" 10
at 4540 press "P1 Button 6" 10
at 4560 press "P1 Button 6" 10
at 4580 press "P1 Button 6" 10
at 4700 press "P1 Button 5" 10
at 4900 snap
at 4950 press "P1 Button 6" 10
at 5000 press "P1 Button 5" 10
at 5100 snap
at 5200 press "Card" 8
at 5300 snap
at 5500 snap
at 5800 snap
at 6100 snap
at 6110 quit
